<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Where to Start | Arrington Consultancy</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Three ways to start working with Arrington Consultancy, what each one costs, and what happens next. A free conversation, a £500 Commercial Review, or a £2,500 Full Commercial Review.">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/where-to-start">
    <meta property="og:type" content="website">
    <meta property="og:title" content="Where to Start | Arrington Consultancy">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Three ways to start working with Arrington Consultancy, what each one costs, and what happens next.">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/where-to-start">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/img/logo">
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Where to Start | Arrington Consultancy">
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Three ways to start working with Arrington Consultancy, what each one costs, and what happens next.">
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.arringtonconsultancy.com/img/logo">
    <meta name="csrf-token" content="<%= csrfToken %>">
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="any">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icons/icon-32.png" type="image/png" sizes="32x32">
    <link rel="icon" href="/icons/icon-16.png" type="image/png" sizes="16x16">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/site.webmanifest">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700;1,400&family=DM+Serif+Display&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=AW-18129914078"></script>
    <script nonce="<%= nonce %>">
        window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
        function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}
        gtag('js', new Date());
        gtag('config', 'AW-18129914078');
        <% if (ga4Id) { %>
        gtag('config', '<%= ga4Id %>');
        <% } %>
    </script>
    <style nonce="<%= nonce %>">
        :root {
            <% for (const [prop, val] of Object.entries(theme.vars)) { %>
            <%= prop %>: <%= val %>;
            <% } %>
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; }
        }
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            background: var(--black);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        <%- include('partials/site-chrome-styles') %>

        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: var(--text-bright);
            line-height: 1.18;
            margin: 0;
        }
        p { color: var(--text); margin: 0; }

        .wts-label {
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.14em;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--accent);
            margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
            display: block;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            max-width: 100%;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.9rem;
            border-radius: 3px;
            text-decoration: none;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: 1px solid transparent;
        }
        .btn-primary { background: var(--accent); color: var(--black); border-color: var(--accent); }
        .btn-primary:hover, .btn-primary:focus-visible { background: var(--accent-hover); border-color: var(--accent-hover); }
        .btn-outline { background: transparent; color: var(--text-bright); border-color: var(--border); }
        .btn-outline:hover, .btn-outline:focus-visible { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

        /* Intro — deliberately tight. This page's job is to be understood in
           seconds, not to build atmosphere before it gets to the point. */
        .wts-intro {
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 7.5rem 1.5rem 2.5rem;
        }
        .wts-intro h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.7rem); margin-bottom: 0.9rem; }
        .wts-intro p { font-size: 1.08rem; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 560px; }

        main { max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem 5rem; }

        /* THE MAIN PATHWAY — three steps, not a pricing table. No shared
           card background, no columns to compare side by side: each step is
           a full-width block read top to bottom, distinguished by a large
           ghost numeral rather than a badge or box. Name and price are
           deliberately glued together on the same line so both register in
           the same glance, on any screen width. */
        .wts-path {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .wts-step {
            position: relative;
            padding: 3rem 0 3rem 4.75rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        }
        .wts-step-marker {
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 2.6rem;
            font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
            font-size: 3.2rem;
            line-height: 1;
            color: var(--accent);
            opacity: 0.22;
            user-select: none;
        }
        .wts-step-head {
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            column-gap: 1.25rem;
            row-gap: 0.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        }
        .wts-step-head h2 { font-size: 1.7rem; }
        .wts-step-price {
            margin-left: auto;
            font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
            font-size: 2.1rem;
            color: var(--accent);
            white-space: nowrap;
        }
        .wts-step-kicker {
            font-size: 0.98rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-style: italic;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        .wts-step-body {
            font-size: 1.02rem;
            max-width: 560px;
            margin-bottom: 1.6rem;
        }
        .wts-step-body strong { color: var(--text-bright); font-weight: 600; }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .wts-step { padding-left: 0; padding-top: 3.4rem; }
            .wts-step-marker { position: static; display: block; font-size: 2.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
        }

        /* WEBSITE BUILD — deliberately set apart from the three steps above:
           a bordered panel rather than another numbered step, quieter CTA,
           its own short framing sentence making the distinction explicit
           rather than leaving it to layout alone. */
        .wts-build {
            margin-top: 3rem;
            padding: 2.75rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .wts-build-head {
            display: flex;
            align-items: baseline;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            column-gap: 1.25rem;
            row-gap: 0.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        }
        .wts-build-head h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
        .wts-build-price {
            margin-left: auto;
            font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: var(--text-bright);
        }
        .wts-build p.wts-build-body { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 520px; margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }

        @media (max-width: 640px) {
            .wts-build { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
        }

        /* SOMETHING ELSE — closing line only, no fanfare, no step marker. */
        .wts-else {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 3.5rem 0 0.5rem;
        }
        .wts-else p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/site-header', { currentPage: { slug: 'where-to-start' }, navPages, canEdit: false, content, pageContact }) %>

    <div class="wts-intro">
        <p class="wts-label">Where to Start</p>
        <h1>Three ways to start working with us.</h1>
        <p>Talk first, or go straight to a fixed-price piece of work. Either way, here is exactly what it costs and what happens next.</p>
    </div>

    <main>
        <div class="wts-path">
            <section class="wts-step" id="conversation-offer">
                <span class="wts-step-marker" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
                <div class="wts-step-head">
                    <h2>30 Minute Conversation</h2>
                    <p class="wts-step-price">£0</p>
                </div>
                <p class="wts-step-kicker">For anyone who is not yet sure what they need.</p>
                <p class="wts-step-body">A straightforward conversation about what is going on in the business. If it is worth taking further, we will say so. If it is not, we will say that too.</p>
                <a href="#conversation" class="btn btn-primary">Start the conversation</a>
            </section>

            <section class="wts-step" id="commercial-review-offer">
                <span class="wts-step-marker" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
                <div class="wts-step-head">
                    <h2><%= offers.commercial_review.name %></h2>
                    <p class="wts-step-price">£<%= (offers.commercial_review.pricePence / 100).toLocaleString('en-GB') %></p>
                </div>
                <p class="wts-step-kicker">A genuine, standalone piece of Tom's commercial judgement.</p>
                <p class="wts-step-body">Tom listens for as long as it takes to properly understand the business, then produces a written report: his assessment, his recommendations and what to do first. Completed within 4 business days. <strong>Fully credited</strong> if you go on to a Full Commercial Review.</p>
                <a href="/where-to-start/commercial-review" class="btn btn-primary">Start your Commercial Review &mdash; £<%= (offers.commercial_review.pricePence / 100).toLocaleString('en-GB') %></a>
            </section>

            <section class="wts-step" id="full-review-offer">
                <span class="wts-step-marker" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
                <div class="wts-step-head">
                    <h2><%= offers.full_commercial_review.name %></h2>
                    <p class="wts-step-price">£<%= (offers.full_commercial_review.pricePence / 100).toLocaleString('en-GB') %></p>
                </div>
                <p class="wts-step-kicker">Depth, access, and help putting the plan into action.</p>
                <p class="wts-step-body">Substantially more time and access, evidence followed rather than assumed, and practical help putting the right things in place once we agree the direction. Completed within 4 weeks.</p>
                <a href="/where-to-start/full-commercial-review" class="btn btn-primary">Start your Full Commercial Review &mdash; £<%= (offers.full_commercial_review.pricePence / 100).toLocaleString('en-GB') %></a>
            </section>
        </div>

        <section class="wts-build" id="website-build-offer">
            <p class="wts-label">A different kind of project</p>
            <div class="wts-build-head">
                <h2>Website Build</h2>
                <p class="wts-build-price">From £999</p>
            </div>
            <p class="wts-build-body">A genuinely bespoke website, built properly. This is build work, not commercial diagnosis &mdash; a different kind of project from the two reviews above.</p>
            <a href="/websites-and-ai" class="btn btn-outline">See the website offer</a>
        </section>

        <section class="wts-else" id="something-else-offer">
            <p>Something else? Tell us what is going on and we will tell you honestly whether we can help.</p>
            <a href="#conversation" class="btn btn-outline">Tell us what you need</a>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/site-footer', { canEdit: false, pageContact, content }) %>
    <script nonce="<%= nonce %>">
        <%- include('partials/site-chrome-script') %>
    </script>
</body>
</html>
